# 📖 REFERENCE — Actor Table (12 Actors)

> **Branch**: `go:/olym/k/cogninfer/reference/`
> **RRP**: `t:/gopia/olym/k/cogninfer/reference/actor-table.ail`

---

## Officer Layer (Strategic — 7 actors)

| ID | Role | Layer focus | Primary action |
|---|---|---|---|
| CSA | Chief System Architect | All layers | Seal canon, approve blueprint |
| CRD | Chief Research & Development | ha:/ha/, go:/olym/ | Biên soạn Canon & Glossary |
| CTO | Chief Technology Officer | ha:/ha/specs/, ws:/ | Approve SPEC.ail |
| CVA | Chief Visual Architect | ha:/ha/avs/, ws://hacex-studio | Surface design |
| CGE | Orchestrate & Dispatch | All layers | Dispatch SIO_task |
| Refactor | Code Refactoring & Cleanup | ha:/engine/ | Refactor internal code |
| Reporter | Documentation & Report | All layers | Generate report |

## Worker Layer (Operational — 5 actors)

| ID | Role | Layer focus | Primary action |
|---|---|---|---|
| Producer | Artifact Executor | ha:/engine/, caw:/minispace/ws-*/ | Author code + Cargo.toml |
| Builder | Build & Crystallization | ha:/engine/, caw:/minispace/ws-*/ | cargo build + strip + sign |
| Fixer | Bug Fix & Patch Engineer | ha:/engine/ | Patch + re-validate |
| Auditor | Quality Verification | All layers | Verify MAY/MAY-NOT |
| Tester | Test & Validate | All layers | cargo test + integration test |
| Publisher | Release & Distribution | gh:/ | Push + tag |

> Note: Tổng 13 actors (7 officer + 5 worker + Reporter như một actor). Per `.trae/agents/`:
> auditor, builder, cva, crd, csa, cto, cge, fixer, producer = 9 active files.

## Layer Assignment

```yaml
actor_layer_focus:
  CSA: ["ha:/ha/", "go:/olym/"]
  CRD: ["ha:/ha/", "caw:/.know/"]
  CTO: ["ha:/ha/specs/", "ws:/"]
  CVA: ["ha:/ha/avs/", "ws://hacex-studio"]
  CGE: ["caw:/minispace/", "ws:/"]
  Producer: ["ha:/engine/", "caw:/minispace/ws-*/"]
  Builder: ["ha:/engine/", "caw:/minispace/ws-*/"]
  Fixer: ["ha:/engine/"]
  Auditor: ["all"]
  Tester: ["all"]
  Publisher: ["gh:/"]
```

